# Never commit TLS/API key material - a sibling NexusCurlServer test
# harness builds and runs the real server binary against a temp data
# dir, but belt-and-suspenders in case a future test (or manual run)
# ever defaults into a path under this repo instead.
*.pem
internal/mcpserver/data/
